    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d467">

                <pb facs="0553" n="441" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg441"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.01/134: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul General at
                        Irkutsk</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Harris</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >temporarily at Omsk</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-15T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 15,
                                1919, 4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>The President’s serious illness precludes for the time being the possibility of a
                    decision as to the matters discussed in your 386, <pb facs="0554" n="442"
                        xml:id="pg442"/> September 19, 5 p.m.,<anchor n="86" xml:id="d467-f1"/> but
                    they will be taken up at the earliest possible moment.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d467-f1" n="86" xml:id="d467-f1-content">
                <p>Transmitted in telegram from the Chargé in China, Sept. 22, <ref target="#pg427"
                        >p. 427</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
